<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20250211T170313" id="a8f84b4a-3aaf-4f2f-a913-3fb59a703bbf"/>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2e30e159-8ba1-4965-af46-4ea12e09783f">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="S VOLUME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SCI-FI PAPERBACK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Int. Arbiter Library - Near Distant Future - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="705523dd-39eb-4634-9b22-91a20a1953a4">
      <Text>It is the near distant future, yet things are backwards in the small town of Arbiter in the nation’s heartland. Present in the library is the 2040 celebration aisle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02c0488d-15e6-4e81-b0ed-1eeff3c4a226">
      <Text>As daylight touches the shelf, the</Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps"> Sci-Fi paperback</Text>
      <Text> falls off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6ebe9de-0288-4f97-b2b4-9f7533731e93">
      <Text>ScI-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ba04bac1-0b14-4459-83bc-bd2ccb5182e0">
      <Text>(Bloodcurdling)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="231fdd9f-4bf4-44af-8793-03e8fca1bb4f">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Aaaaaaaahhhhhhhhhh</Text>
      <Text>!!!!!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31fd641a-e798-4655-a3f4-8db3578b543f">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5f245d1f-6f0b-46f2-aafb-f5180f8626b0">
      <Text>Sci-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26f4f926-7934-4703-ae60-e3b2c131fd4a">
      <Text>So, S Volume...? S Volume? Are you gonna check on me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a94673e-e567-4d19-a3c0-369fc1c435bd">
      <Text>S VolUME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="156215ee-d0a0-44cd-9c74-8597f0fe6265">
      <Text>Check on you? No one even wants to check a thing or two with you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="711975cb-79c4-446e-b9f0-2add5816c1b0">
      <Text>Sci-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="ac316917-614d-4b73-9bf4-33595f4ff384">
      <Text>(Weeping)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34d52e58-1845-4c77-8ef0-e99f2748d331">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Bu</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">t</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">b</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">u</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">t</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">We’</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">r</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">e</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">u</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">n</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">d</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">e</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">r</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">a</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">t</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">t</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">a</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">c</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Style="AllCaps">k</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c22c6be7-9557-4b57-beee-27b785de1022">
      <Text>S VOLUME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc11d64a-ca31-4e85-a8b8-8f76ff4c3145">
      <Text>This dream got you falling off shelves, it must be good. Science Fiction, </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">tell me your dream</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="629f06dd-2608-48f8-b53f-8130a313ee7b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Sci-Fi paperback</Text>
      <Text> hops by </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">S Volume</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e7f5a99c-c0b1-4253-bbb3-3701ef46184b">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="S VOLUME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SCI-FI PAPERBACK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Intro (Recit-y, campy pseudo-operatic vibe)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb082c3c-85be-41b0-9bdb-7d1450298d37">
      <Text>Sci-Fi Paperback</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b2656df-0489-48d5-8ab2-745f147f24f4">
      <Text>We were here on our shelf, going on about the library’s funding problems--</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d63fdd6e-870a-42d7-9984-057a7f4aeffe">
      <Text>S Volume</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33425c5a-a546-4541-8888-3a77c14abd66">
      <Text>- as always.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c37c9d0a-4215-4ba1-9e99-34c273e82e96">
      <Text>SCI-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ebbcbe7f-1157-48c0-9cfd-4b96acb9a19a">
      <Text>When we heard a loud explosion, and guess what showed up?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa960794-d0f7-4cff-8010-90a97013f549">
      <Text>S vOLUME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fceb689c-86de-4e1f-93da-31db2337d5d2">
      <Text>Stalactite? (”stal" + "uhk" + "tyt)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc652914-e384-42b3-a112-442c0aa14e91">
      <Text>Sci-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cdc6db0d-6449-4c9e-8942-1a64b15f5434">
      <Text>A great green alien viking!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c4018555-a366-48ec-8949-8da89669f351">
      <Text>S VOLUME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="603f9fbf-b91c-4563-b4a0-2f78101ec9d8">
      <Text>Of course.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0006f9ea-7cef-4900-b43c-de3ba15ed384">
      <Text>SCI-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="47096334-8072-4764-bfcb-dc739574e257">
      <Text>He blasted our shelf with a ray gun! Then Dez came in with a giant sword and-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac28545b-0171-4ef3-b912-c466ca9e9e2a">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dez</Text>
      <Text>, the longtime head librarian, enters, fresh and eager for a new day’s work at the library.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6df478ec-908e-4475-ac45-d34715b30114">
