      </SceneProperties>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="86bbdf36-973d-469b-8f54-6d289461008e">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DEWEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DEZ">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TONI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">5. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">E is for everything</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5be9eb4-42e2-49d9-9530-caf10a4c6bec">
      <Text>DEZ</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6cdacfe-9958-4d63-b3e0-566620ac4781">
      <Text>You were no kid. You’ve always been a monster. Writing your name on everything was the worst experience I’ve had here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8cb0736b-55ec-4afc-adbe-aeec9fbdabfe">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3dd6d6fb-c2b7-4561-b94b-aba52cd256db">
      <Text>Boo </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">hoo</Text>
      <Text>. You had to do such menial tasks when you were an intern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a9e90a5-c308-41e8-bc06-494a98747cfa">
      <Text>DEZ</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e728c42-832b-47bd-a532-3ba9362eb5e7">
      <Text>Cleaning permanent markers ink was not my profession.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c79e8590-74db-4425-b865-5cf4621ac9c1">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fbf3a030-f848-40d2-9649-71cc1144a6b6">
      <Text>It was unprofessional of you to suspend my library card.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b092067-166c-45b5-b392-dc971d03e02d">
      <Text>DEZ</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54eb2c10-f06b-4539-8051-80a80c6f1cd0">
      <Text>It’s been a few decades. Move on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="24034936-fa63-4a75-8663-1103607bc3d3">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e38c8021-fb12-43c5-82b8-f752935ec8d0">
      <Text>Oh, I’m moving on into the future with </Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline">ease</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e81ae51-4137-4358-8bca-13f3a68513fa">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text> pushes a button. Everything is renamed: “Sexton.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5b227d42-4221-49ee-b156-566b34225028">
      <Text>Toni</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="61a5f3eb-cc02-4e91-be86-c9632a477560">
      <Text>E is for Everything</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="df74a7a4-e238-4eb6-b266-4a97344ad8e3">
      <Text>And Everything is mine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="2a9f099e-130c-4894-a227-24aabb29f1be">
      <Text>My Electronic books will have</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="2040ae3c-eb5a-4565-a0f6-9570c0487f06">
      <Text>A giant custom sign!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2c08623e-5b8c-4084-b2e6-69d42466c78c">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="81d05d5f-85bc-4a5d-a4ae-ca84658835a4">
      <Text>E is for Everything</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5f9ca6ad-c247-40dd-a443-40db78818c62">
      <Text>We have that’s working fine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="4d4fc438-d150-4db1-8693-447ace1289ef">
      <Text>Our printed, lovely books are what</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="7b998ad8-a50f-4e17-ae4f-c4777b009bd6">
      <Text>Make this haven shine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="acb7f0e2-ffb7-4090-a3c1-99c6bf13fc26">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> shuts the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">sci-fi paperback</Text>
      <Text> abruptly without a glimpse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4211ad54-d352-4a7f-b8ab-97d17fe44b6d">
      <Text>DewEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="9e7f12fa-7842-47fe-b4a1-8b63c41054ce">
      <Text>So E might be for Everything—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ebe3c63b-1a27-4c90-bcf9-d1f99f88028f">
      <Text>Why should I even care?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="cdb8890c-558c-48a6-96c1-23f6ccd8f640">
      <Text>I’ve never read print books before,</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ef6156e9-62c7-4b69-8ad3-85f4bdc87a9b">
      <Text>I should walk right on out that door</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="9981f25f-bc5f-4a6d-aa6f-1f88ac55c0d7">
      <Text>Return to screens and their blue glare.
</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="e461f4fb-b343-4383-b674-45f74f204231">
      <Text>So E might be for Everything—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="36aca059-d6f6-49ad-a497-f8aae37f5ca3">
      <Text>Why do I find I care?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="65479c6c-52e9-4d02-87b5-f79e476385ba">
      <Text>The fumes of ink and dust have lit</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="f458b434-484c-475e-9dcc-aff4cc1decdf">
      <Text>A spark in me that burns to split</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6d6ac6a6-4048-449e-86c1-bbc281a5c13f">
      <Text>My old life plan from this new air.
</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="7d1fbae0-4d89-4abb-909f-86cbd1f1da6a">
      <Text>These shelves seem so familiar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c8808f41-9d87-4d82-a7f5-b382f06cb23e">
      <Text>Did Gran bring me as a child?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="d5362f63-5f6b-4940-ab42-3fac7f4082f9">
      <Text>Read me books about white wizards,</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="167285c7-68b7-4d74-93df-6e7ea87c8626">
      <Text>Absent heroes, talking clouds?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="813c87ef-b2de-447b-8420-848c3de92b87">
      <Text>Did we sit on that worn story rug?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="f77d17c0-b243-4e44-9b91-37e81e1f28eb">
      <Text>End our tales with a laugh and a warm hug?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="9c54f0f4-f9e9-4cd7-9f8a-73b8eda3f3cc">
      <Text>And could I get that back?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="81078f97-3a07-4fa4-b685-565c306846df">
      <Text>Yes, Could I get that back?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dbe1dd96-ba59-4024-89e4-a4d5ca4d26c8">
      <Text>And do Grandma and her friends all know</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="e6b5a8d6-ac8b-4729-ba5a-0e474cba7c0e">
      <Text>Toni Sexton wants their books to go?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f85f954-b09b-4ac9-9cb8-ad6f5ff90dff">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> opens the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">sci-fi paperback</Text>
      <Text> slightly. It’s as though they trust one another. </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> uses their ears.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8c39c11e-1e32-47de-9b89-a96ee4578c26">
      <Text>DewEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5d57f108-d5c6-4c05-9a63-564b520bdc1d">
      <Text>So E -- E is for Everything—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="d3213023-a539-4add-b783-e98e088652e4">
      <Text>Yes, Yes, I find I care!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="afd47f64-6987-4ee4-bb66-c4555cb8acd6">
      <Text>So Toni Thinks he’s super fine--</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0e346e52-4542-45c5-b97c-bf9bfbedfcf4">
      <Text>I’ll put his selfish views online</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="e4cd40f1-b9fd-478e-91c3-fdfd30e1f338">
      <Text>For all the world to judge and share,
to judge and share.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a96e3578-23a2-46db-8e72-3ca33f52c0a7">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 1/8" Page="15" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DEWEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DEZ">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="S VOLUME">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="S VOLUME &amp; SCI-FI PAPERBACK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SCI-FI PAPERBACK">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TONI">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TONI’S PHONE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">E is for everything</Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870e70aa-f1bb-43be-9c93-5bf2794830e3">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text> whips out a giant Sharpie and nabs the</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>nearest</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>book.</Text>
      <Text Size="10"> </Text>
      <Text>It’s...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="01cf6407-4daa-4b4a-913d-5664bd278022">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81e39678-e695-40d7-9c37-5e796ae44ed4">
      <Text>No! That’s a Shakespeare first folio edition... 1589. Is this the hill you wanna die on?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dae41262-ce0c-471a-b7ec-dd584742b993">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed5a3e6d-c593-4e52-8bd7-2a377b5e4aaf">
      <Text>Every hill in this land will have my name written, too!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad37fc6b-7d91-4987-ba53-271fae3a1190">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dez</Text>
      <Text> get in a tussle. It ends with </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text> triumphing but getting a papercut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f4aaa61-c016-4cd2-9e90-4b2e053d8a9b">
      <Text>Toni</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b41f155-0ed6-4c5a-b57c-de1c3968a980">
      <Text>Ow, papercut...! It will have blood, they say: blood will have blood!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cee6960-5788-4eeb-b167-fac875a0088c">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text> writes their name in blood.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6208aff8-9c33-442c-b2c2-c3851121cc41">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> takes a photo of this insanity and sends it out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d293d76e-a4d9-4914-92c2-c85dd4df502b">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text>’s phone rings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81c32588-3f1a-4d20-8645-686fc61aae1b">
      <Text>Toni’s Phone</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42ce4634-0f58-428a-80b6-33fc454dd58b">
      <Text Style="Italic">Ring, ring! You’ve got blood</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59a9c9fc-45dd-4002-aab9-d12f6ae8ace1">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74cb570e-fd60-4194-a2b3-aa0c23267022">
      <Text>Oh the board! They’re gonna put their foot down in your termination, Dewey Dez!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0fb45ab1-fe69-4bd0-b918-bee4ac13bd62">
      <Text>TONI’S PHONE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cba10570-fe3a-439a-ac51-2f022eb37474">
      <Text>...</Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">on your hands</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="903e0d77-9efd-4a8c-8beb-fb2fd1f2cdde">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c5d7ce6-171f-439c-a775-b5d691881b36">
      <Text>Hands?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04f8e273-2603-471b-a4d1-85e9c684dbef">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text> picks up the phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="daf1f03e-1693-4f7e-985c-f7bd2abfbc89">
      <Text>Toni</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52997dcc-50f7-4c4f-a31f-93006d5e29e0">
      <Text>Your majesty board president- Uh... You got the intern’s email, what? You’re rejecting my donation?! Health code violation?! It’s Shakespeare. No one knows who he is without my name in blood! It’s priceless!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49ec8146-ccdf-4778-90ee-0a0683cb3fb5">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> films this interaction and uploads this to the Arbiter community listserv.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d59308af-a1ba-4505-bc44-9253b2a7aae3">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dez</Text>
      <Text> looks at the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text>’s phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf8e07c3-0001-4a8d-9c0d-6a51aed483bc">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a0882c0-4f57-4159-8dac-7a7bcf535182">
      <Text>No... This is priceless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5511f09c-abbb-4f5f-8d4e-f1a9a06f1165">
      <Text>TONI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d33139a7-1be6-483a-ace8-693bd6e9f28c">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7c715458-a751-4d81-b97d-689b87dba0ed">
      <Text>DEZ</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20bd798c-09ec-452e-965a-40263df48a9c">
      <Text>The comments.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3d0cd7fd-e8ce-496e-8653-a6fd319ed8a0">
      <Text>Dewey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="9054d415-19e6-4759-af54-51b9cb538c73">
      <Text>(Reading)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87e41798-fd63-4655-87e5-f67cec4c9c26">
      <Text>“Don’t you dare touch my Shaky.”
“To be or not to be. No one wants to be Toni Sexton today.”
“Sexton thinks this is a Shakespearean comedy. This is a tragedy.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac11c796-59cc-4bb3-b0d2-af9e0092baec">
      <Text>Toni</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7998f521-63a2-4d1c-b8ff-549b6080a719">
      <Text>The tragedy here is this whole town! It’s the middle of the 21st century and Arbiter is still so backwards.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef25b0ca-8d21-40ed-9f28-5793b5653259">
      <Text>Dewey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3e866ab-c1f3-4d38-a58e-8c2cb69af53c">
      <Text>Look, even backwards town has listservs and Arbiter is no different!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf0d7bf4-c8e7-414d-848c-542ecc654635">
      <Text>Arbiter Library gets a sudden makeover by coders around the nation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c7494ae-a6ee-4d1c-9332-5d3838ca3b8e">
      <Text>Toni</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="588266db-9c92-4e0b-8fad-0f94e5715c69">
      <Text>Don’t </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">unsexton</Text>
      <Text> the world!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="50e5903a-cfa5-498b-bdbc-a9a07e339ee3">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc778b44-b131-406c-a466-68644bebe91c">
      <Text>Wow. What possessed you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05719c60-5cb1-4625-9010-5839a513e7af">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> holds the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">sci-fi paperback</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="581a5f07-c357-4b9b-88a2-0cab8ae97ed3">
      <Text>Many of the updated electronics in Arbiter Library fail and combust.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc89a10a-5c57-44eb-b6cd-80f057488774">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dez</Text>
      <Text> reads a passage in the </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">sci-fi paperback</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="947d1dba-9bc5-46e4-b114-afe976c133d1">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="5db81292-cd9c-48ed-a340-007940ece3f5">
      <Text>(Reading)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="46fd3f59-44ba-4363-a960-ae43cbd4a772">
      <Text>Ah, the third act of humans beating the egotistical wealthy billionaire who hires twenty-something year </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">olds</Text>
      <Text> to pillage social security. Absurd, but it works out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc89a10a-5c57-44eb-b6cd-80f057488774">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">sci-fi paperback</Text>
      <Text> hops by </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">S Volume</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0578b90d-fd23-4844-a51c-2d816acf71e6">
      <Text>Sci-Fi PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2eb2139f-2991-4cd9-8387-2f233dcd1b38">
      <Text>(Clears throat) </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">No one wants to check with me, huh</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="665a3c4b-c566-45ab-9db2-4b143aa19633">
      <Text>S Volume</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1786e07f-0180-4504-9876-419c02c6f2ec">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Gotta</Text>
      <Text> hand it to ya, Sci-Fi. You got Arbiter Library out of a decades’ long bind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57ced3ca-bde7-45e2-a79d-6c8e85a0ad01">
      <Text>SCI-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cd008e6-c6c6-482e-9880-1e922225c5fc">
      <Text>Science makes things work out, S Volume. Now...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f3d755a-d456-4112-b6a3-5017093067e5">
      <Text>S VOLUME &amp; SCI-FI PAPERBACK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1786e07f-0180-4504-9876-419c02c6f2ec">
      <Text>Let’s spiral bind this deadbeat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1333a0d6-cde7-4cdd-8432-5ac31a55e09f">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">S Volume</Text>
      <Text> and </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Sci-Fi Paperback</Text>
      <Text> chase out </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Toni</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed3e80bc-491b-4f3b-af1c-9632f5f47a34">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="516109e1-f536-481a-ab09-38e927ef4669">
      <Text>(Reading the phone)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="73840379-a41c-4a02-b3ee-8273a2c02f68">
      <Text>It is priceless. Priceless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19e92ded-1663-48ec-a65d-2dac667ed924">
      <Text>Dewey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="222a7ae7-6383-4b97-bea0-bc2f6aae0c0d">
      <Text>Donations are streaming into the library’s account! 2 dollars. 42 dollars. 451. All from the community!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a58f8d46-f0ce-4238-942a-6025def08288">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dez</Text>
      <Text> dusts off a badge printer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="89f5d2de-d368-48d8-ad52-ca2a5573a787">
      <Text>Dez</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3ce44e34-bd12-4c8d-96f8-b7ec526cbd6d">
      <Text>We can afford to use the badge printer again! It may be against the core principle to label the library’s content. But, we must put a name to the lovely people who make Arbiter Library and every library in the world come to life! You’ll </Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+Italic+Underline">manage</Text>
      <Text>, being in the </Text>
      <Text Style="Bold+Italic+Underline">middle</Text>
      <Text> of it all.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4281336-0de7-4612-911b-1f38bfff0341">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dez</Text>
      <Text> pins a badge to </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Dewey</Text>
      <Text> that reads: “Dewey, Arbiter Intern.”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c522469a-2221-4024-ab03-8eeff825853f">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="18" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
    </Paragraph>
