        <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">, adult, Arbiter Library’s passionate librarian </Text>
      </Paragraph>
